## A person that someone [[hang out|hangs out]] with.
##* {{quote-book|en|title=The Complex Infrastructure Known as the Female Mind|passage=She might announce something to everyone that makes no sense or tells a story that rambles on and on and makes no point. But for some reason nobody seems to mind. We all just like to listen to The Airhead. She's a fun '''hang'''.|year=2004|author=Relient K, Mark Nichols|page=76|isbn=9781418552800|publisher=Thomas Nelson}}
##* {{quote-web|en|url=https://www.nytimes.com/2018/07/18/arts/music/benny-blanco-interview.html|work=New York Times|passage="I couldn't sit down and play a concert for you or really wow you on any instrument," Mr. Blanco said, estimating that "like 75 percent" of his success comes from being a good '''hang'''. "What I can do is meet an artist, know what type of song I think we should make and be their therapist, make everyone feel comfortable."|title=How Benny Blanco Became the Most Popular Oddball in Pop Music|date=2018-07-18|author=Joe Coscarelli}}
