===Etymology===
From {{inh|vi|mkh-vie-pro|*haːŋ||cave}}. Possibly related to the word reconstructed as {{cog|mkh-pro|*ʔaaŋ||to open}} by Shorto (2006).

===Pronunciation===
{{vi-IPA}}

