{{vi-noun|cls=cái|[[𡎟]], [[𥧎]], [[𧯄]], [[𧯅]], [[𪨝]]}}

# [[cave]]
#: {{syn|vi|động}}
# [[den]]

====Usage notes====
* There seems to be little consistency on which between ''hang'' or {{m|vi|động}} would be used in cave names (for examples, '''''hang''''' {{m|vi|Sơn Đoòng}}, but '''''động''''' {{m|vi|Phong Nha}}). In some cases, both can be seen used.

